== Effects ==
* Upon use, consumes 1 {{E|Penny}} and has a chance to drop a random [[pickup]], like a {{M|Slot Machine}}.
** Unlike a {{M|Slot Machine}}, the default reaction to using a bad [[Pill]] will occur if the Portable Slot grants nothing.
