== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r+}} Portable Slot can be obtained as final pay out from a {{m|Slot Machine}}.
* Unlike normal Slot Machines, the Portable Slot can't explode, nor can it drop {{i|A Dollar}}, although it can still grant [[Pretty Fly|Pretty Flies]].
* {{dlc|r}} The item only costs 10 coins when found in a {{r|Shop}}.
* {{Dlc|r}} This item can be crafted from {{i|Bag of Crafting|n}} with eight {{e|Penny|text=Pennies}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Gives the wisps of the following items depending on the reward:
** {{e|Fly}}: Nothing.
** {{e|Bomb}}: {{i|Mr. Boom}} wisp.
** {{e|Penny||Coin}}: Coin wisp for each coin dropped.
** {{e|Red Heart||Heart}}: {{i|Yum Heart}} wisp.
** {{e|Key}}: {{i|Dad's Key}} wisp.
** [[Pill]]: {{i|Mom's Bottle of Pills}} wisp.
** [[Pretty Fly]]: 2-4 {{i|Guppy's Head}} wisps.}}
* {{t|Equality!|r+}}: Allows Isaac to get rid of coins and potentially spawn bombs and keys, making it easier to keep the number of pickups the same.
* {{i|IV Bag}}: Can be alternated between to gain ridiculous amounts of pickups from only a few initial coins or hearts.
* {{c|Keeper}}: Can be used to spawn coins in the room to heal Keeper.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.

