== Trivia ==
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', Portable Slot could be used to spawn an enemy Fly after defeating the boss in a {{R|Boss Room}}, which would enable Isaac to leave the room and come back, facing another boss battle and obtaining another item.
** Also, hearts spawned from Portable Slot were affected by what room it was used in, such as {{E|Eternal Heart}}s spawning when used in {{S|Cathedral}}.

